    "bb gates --include_gates_per_opcode on the compiled short64 circuit, joined with the artifact's raw-deflate debug_symbols (acir_locations + location_tree) to attribute gates to source lines.",
    "Source variants compiled with nargo to measure individual constructs; variants that changed semantics were used for attribution only.",
    "Capacity right-sizing: keep the exact circuit source and signed journal, change only global OPS/SCALARS/BYTES/SAMPLES/CPS, rebuild the witness from the same signed capture, prove, verify, and compare public inputs.",
    "The right-sized profiles keep CPS (and therefore the public journal ABI) unchanged so the resulting public inputs are byte-identical to the current profile's."
